<title>UK: Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 300 mln mark 8yr bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 300 mln mark 8yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE AUSGLEICHSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    25.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    25.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.375     REOFFER    99.25     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT/DUSS  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC   2.05</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
